(text "24 V arrives from the panel XT90 and 7 A breaker on J1. The plug-in power module (PM1) carries the TPS2663 eFuse and the TPS7A4901." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ad635819-f276-4ece-a2ed-d1e3d1983bf5))
(text "PM1 returns protected +24V, and makes +5VA (analog 5 V) from +12V. Its eFuse fault and current-monitor outputs go to the expander and ADC #2." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c297d6f0-767e-42c5-8e3c-22da7da388c6))
(text "Pololu D24V22Fx pinout confirmed from the board: PG, EN, VIN, GND, VOUT (1-5) plus a corner GND (6). EN and PG unused." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1d5294b3-4da2-43a9-a166-debbee65bf9a))
(text "LM1117: tantalum (or ESR-specified) 10 uF on input and output, per the TI datasheet." (at 20.32 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f1cc6984-5f4b-4292-84b8-83a8ff3aff99))
(text "+24V_FIELD feeds limit switches, the orifice selector and the E-stop status contact, through a 0.1 A PTC." (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b07e06f1-3f7e-4918-af50-4d06071dc098))
